{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-023.md","record_count":36,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரது லீலாவா? என்ன லீலா, இன்னைக்கு இவ்வளவு லேட்டா வர்ரே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒண்ணுமில்லே. இன்னைக்கு \"டேட்\" ஒண்ணுல்ல—அதனால்தான் கொஞ்சம் லேட்டு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம், ஆமாம். பால்காரன், தயிர்காரன்...அந்த...சர்வண்டு...இவங்களுக்கெல்லாம் சம்பளம் கொடுக்கனும்ல. அதனால லேட்டா வந்துருப்பே.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்...ஆமாம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தா, கரண்ட்! 'வால்வை' இப்படி அலட்சியமா வைக்காதே! இதோ, நான் ஒருத்தி இருநூறு ரூபாயை எங்கேயோ அலட்சியமா காணாம அடிச்சுட்டு, வீட்டுக்கு என்ன பதில் சொல்றதுன்னு தெரியாம முழிக்கிறேன். அது மாதிரி நீயும் இதை போட்டு ஒடச்சிட்டு முதலாளிகிட்ட என்ன பதில் சொல்றதுன்னு தெரியாம முழிக்காதே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாண்டா, வால்வு ரொம்ப 'காஸ்ட்லீ'டா...கீழே கீழே போட்டுத் தொலைக்காதே! அப்புறம் நம்ப நாடகத்துக்கு ஹீரோயின் கெடைக்காம அலையுறோமே, அது மாதிரி வால்வுக்கு அலைய வேண்டி வரும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உங்க நாடகத்துக்கு இன்னும் கதாநாயகி கெடைக்கிலியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லியே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சார்! நான் ஒண்ணு சொல்றேன்னு கோவிச்சுக்காதீங்க!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ ஏண்டா கோவிச்சுக்கிறே? என்னா சொல்லு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நம்ப லீலா அம்மாவே கதாநாயகியா ஆக்ட் பண்ணுனா என்ன?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சே, சே. அது நல்லா இருக்காது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏன் சார், ஆக்ட் பண்ணத் தெரியாதுன்னு நினைக்கிறீங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"டேய். நான் அதைச் சொல்லலேடா! லீலா ஆக்டே பண்ண வேண்டாமே; சும்மா 'ஸ்டேஜி'லே வந்து நின்னா போதுமே! ஆக்ட் பண்ண மாதிரியே இருக்குமே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்புறம் என்ன சார்...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அது பெரிய எடத்துப் பொண்ணு நாம இப்படி சும்மா ட்ராமா, கீமாவிலே ஆக்ட் பண்ண கூப்பிட்டா அவுங்க வீட்டில ஏதாவது...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லியே! நான் எங்க ஸ்கூல்லகூட நல்லா நடிப்பேனே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஸ்கூல்ல யார் வேணும்னாலும் நடிக்கலாம். அது ஒரு பெரிய காரியமில்ல. ஆனா உண்மையான ட்ராமாவிலே நடிக்கணும்; அப்பத்தான் அதனுடைய கஷ்டம் உனக்குத் தெரியும். ஆனா கரண்ட், லீலா நம்ம நாடகத்திலே நடிக்கிறேன்னு சொன்னா, அது இஷ்டத்துக்கு விரோதமா ஒண்ணும் சொல்ல மாட்டாங்கன்னு நெனைக்கிறேன். என்ன லீலா...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்ப. நாம நாடகத்துக்காக தேடித்தேடி அலைஞ்ச கதாநாயகி கிடைச்சாச்சி!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கெடைச்சாச்சி...கெடைச்சாச்சி! என்ன லீலா, உனக்கு சம்மதந்தானே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"முயற்சி உடையோர் இகழ்ச்சி அடையார்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்—முயற்சி உடையோர்...அதெல்லாம் சும்மா! நானும் காலம்பற ஏழு மணியிலே இருந்து தேடி அலைஞ்சிகிட்டே இருக்கிறேன்: காணாமப் போன பணம் கெடைக்கவே இல்லை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பணம் காணாமப் போச்சே...எவ்வளவு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சும்மா 200 ரூபா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"200 தானே! டோண்டு ஒரி...நான் குடுக்கிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நான் குடுக்கிறேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வேண்டாம், வேண்டாம். ஒண்ணா ரெண்டா: ரூபா 200ல்ல!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பரவாயில்லை, வச்சிக்கோ! இந்தா லீலா, வச்சிக்கோ! காணாமப் போன விஷயம் வீட்டுக்கேத் தெரிய வேண்டாம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"கரண்ட்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தாங்க...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னா இது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d034","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கதாநாயகி பாடம்—அது பாடம்! இது பணம்! அதை வச்சிக்கோ...இதைப் படிச்சிக்கோ!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":39,"printed_page":38}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d035","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி. பாடம் பண்ணி வைக்கிறேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":40,"printed_page":39}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s023-d036","scene_id":"raja-rani-s023","scene_ordinal":23,"transition_audit_id":"T023","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நாளைக்கு ஒத்திகை வச்சிருக்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":40,"printed_page":39}],"source_scene_file":"scene-023.md"}]}